if we have an object with a complex geometry.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:11.680
And the fact that the AI also understands this&nbsp;
about our world. I am truly speechless. Beautiful.

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:18.320
Five, it can also create new&nbsp;
inventions. This is a toilet car.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:23.680
You know, some people are quite busy and&nbsp;
if you have to go when you are on the go,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:28.080
well, this one is for you.&nbsp;
What a time to be alive!

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:36.000
Six, in this one, the AI puts up a clinic in&nbsp;
understanding combinations of concepts. Check&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:43.280
